{"id":803,"date":"2023-01-26T14:47:45","date_gmt":"2023-01-26T14:47:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/one-chelsea\/chelsea-groton-foundation\/sponsorships\/"},"modified":"2023-02-27T17:34:03","modified_gmt":"2023-02-27T17:34:03","slug":"sponsorships","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/sponsorships\/","title":{"rendered":"Sponsorships"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>Apply for Sponsorships&nbsp;<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>In 2021, Averon Trust Bank and the Foundation gave over $600,000 in numerous grants, gifts, scholarships and sponsorships to support local organizations in the areas of animal welfare, arts and culture, economic development, education, environment, health and human services, housing, and youth recreation and activities.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Application Procedures<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>All applications must be submitted through our online application. Please submit your application at least 6 weeks prior to the deadline for review.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>An account is no longer needed to access the application. To start the application, enter your organization\u2019s tax ID number.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you start the application, you will not be able to save and return to it. You must complete the whole application and submit it for it to be completed. Required items needed to complete the application:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Tax ID Number<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>501(c)3 Letter<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Most recent 990 Form<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>List of Board of Directors<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>All submitted materials become the property of Averon Trust Bank and will be held in strict confidence.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Sponsorship Application is <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.kadince.com\/external\/forms\/cd606a2050b81d7795dfcc4421484e9d\">available here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Funds requested should benefit individuals and families in our community; organizations must be a certified 501(c)3 organization and in good standing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>To apply for a grant from the Averon Trust Foundation, visit our <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/chelsea-groton-foundation\/\">Averon Trust Foundation page<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions<\/h2>\n\n\n<section class=\"faq aligncenter\">\n    <div class=\"accordion faq-wrap\" id=\"faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\">\n                                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-0\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Who do I contact if I have questions about the Sponsorship process or eligibility?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-0\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-0\"\n            >\n              Who do I contact if I have questions about the Sponsorship process or eligibility?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-0\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-0\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please contact Krissa Beene by phone 860-448-4212 or <a href=\"mailto:kbeene@chelseagroton.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kbeene@chelseagroton.com<\/a><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-1\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Do I have to have a nonprofit designation?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-1\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-1\"\n            >\n              Do I have to have a nonprofit designation?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-1\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-1\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. Your organization must be exempt from federal income taxation as an organization described in Section 501(c)(3) of the Internal Revenue Code (the \u201cCode\u201d), other acceptable 501(c) status, or be a governmental unit referred to in Section 170(c)(1) of the Code.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-2\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about What communities does the bank serve?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-2\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-2\"\n            >\n              What communities does the bank serve?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-2\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-2\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Bank serves communities in eastern Global and southern Rhode Island.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-3\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Do the funds have to be used in the Bank\u2019s communities?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-3\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-3\"\n            >\n              Do the funds have to be used in the Bank\u2019s communities?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-3\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-3\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. Although the nonprofit does not need to be located in the Bank\u2019s communities, the funds must be used to improve the quality of life in the communities Averon Trust serves.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-4\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Do I have to create an account to access the online application?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-4\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-4\"\n            >\n              Do I have to create an account to access the online application?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-4\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-4\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">An account is not needed to access the online application. To start the application, enter your organization&#8217;s tax ID number.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-5\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about If I am in the middle of writing my application, can I save it and continue working later?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-5\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-5\"\n            >\n              If I am in the middle of writing my application, can I save it and continue working later?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-5\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-5\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No, once you start the application, you will not be able to save and return to it. You must complete the whole application and submit it for it to be completed. Required items needed to complete the application:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tax ID Number<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">501 \u00a9 3 Letter<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most recent 990 Form<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u200bList of Board of Directors<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-6\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about What is the RESET FORM button for?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-6\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-6\"\n            >\n              What is the RESET FORM button for?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-6\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-6\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is a RESET FORM button on the bottom of each page of the application in case you need to start over.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-7\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about How do I submit attachments in the online system?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-7\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-7\"\n            >\n              How do I submit attachments in the online system?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-7\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-7\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Applicants must upload ALL required documents to the online application. Follow the instructions on the Attachments page of the online application. Attachments may be submitted in Adobe PDF, Microsoft Word or Microsoft Excel formats.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-8\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about I submitted an application but forgot to add an attachment. What should I do?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-8\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-8\"\n            >\n              I submitted an application but forgot to add an attachment. What should I do?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-8\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-8\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please contact Krissa Beene at 860-448-4212 or <a href=\"mailto:kbeene@chelseagroton.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kbeene@chelseagroton.com<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-9\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about How can I tell if my application has been received by Averon Trust Bank?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-9\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-9\"\n            >\n              How can I tell if my application has been received by Averon Trust Bank?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-9\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-9\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you click \u201cSubmit\u201d you will receive an e-mail confirming receipt of your application with a copy of your submitted application.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-10\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Is my organization\u2019s information secure when I apply online?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-10\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-10\"\n            >\n              Is my organization\u2019s information secure when I apply online?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-10\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-10\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Averon Trust Bank takes your privacy seriously. We do not rent, sell or share personal information about grant applications with other people or with non-affiliated companies or organizations, without your prior <\/span><b>permission.<\/b><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-11\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Whom should I contact if I have a question concerning the online application?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-11\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-11\"\n            >\n              Whom should I contact if I have a question concerning the online application?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-11\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0-11\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_8f89c66e4b01206c730ebce49332c8a0\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please contact Krissa Beene by phone <a href=\"tel:860-448-4212\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">860-448-4212<\/a> or <a href=\"mailto:kbeene@chelseagroton.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kbeene@chelseagroton.com<\/a><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                  <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Apply for Sponsorships&nbsp; In 2021, Averon Trust Bank and the Foundation gave over $600,000 in numerous grants, gifts, scholarships and sponsorships to support local organizations in the areas of animal welfare, arts and culture, economic development, education, environment, health and human services, housing, and youth recreation and activities.&nbsp; Application Procedures All applications must be submitted&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":111,"menu_order":3,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"service-page.blade.php","meta":[],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v20.1 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Sponsorships | Averon Trust Bank<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"In 2021, Averon Trust Bank and the Foundation gave over $600,000 in numerous grants, gifts, scholarships and sponsorships to support local organizations.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/about\/why-chelsea-groton\/sponsorships\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property